1 open rows (N14753 to N14753 in search order), each closed by C16 for squarefree n
(`not_hasSDS_of_cosetRow`) and the coset search on a quotient of order prime to n (generated by
`solver/a7rows.py`).
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace SignedDifferenceSets.CosetRows

set_option maxRecDepth 100000

theorem n14753_slice0 : cosetSlice [1, 1, 27] 9 158 1 22 20 2 0 5 = true := by
  decide +kernel

